g of gay disco. Journal of Popular Music Studies, 18(2), 144-166. (http://www.timlawrence.info/articles/pdfs/IWantToSeeAllMyFriendsAtOnce.pdf)','Heather Wilson','wilsonh@email.unc.edu',0,'Y',1241525937926,1241525937926),(14,243,'release','public','big l is one of the illest to ever touch a mic. check out what some call the invention of horrorcore','Brian H','bheim@email.unc.edu',0,'Y',1245316957475,1245316957475),(15,50257,'release','public','Not found in the shelf','Joseph','palis@unc.edu',0,'Y',1248380165774,1248380165774),(16,37828,'release','public','Not found in the shelf','Joseph','palis@unc.edu',0,'Y',1248380201138,1248380201138),(17,49659,'release','public','A remarkably refreshing blend of psychedellic rock with synthy 80\'s dream-pop and soft metal.  This band is quite instrumentally talented.','Alex Carll','carll@unc.edu',0,'Y',1253637172963,1253637172963),(18,814,'release','error','The album seems to be missing.  Possibly mis-filed or stolen.','Alex Carll','carll@unc.edu',0,'Y',1253661628377,1253661628377),(19,13585,'release','public','also in Classical (KO-03)','dvd','dvd@wxyc.org',0,'Y',1274217837857,1274217837857),(20,21223,'release','public','artist also in Clasical (PI 02)','dvd','dvd@wxyc.org',0,'Y',1274306890394,1274306890394),(21,48774,'release','public','Nomination: Best Album Title','Jon','jwoneill@unc.edu',0,'Y',1275917753397,1275917753397),(22,37119,'release','error','MISSING / (Very) MISFILED','Jon','jwoneill@unc.edu',0,'Y',1275947410089,1275947410089),(23,10819,'release','public','Track 1 skips towards the very end... The CD player in the listening room won\'t recognize that there is a disc inserted. Make sure the CD players will read it before going on-air','David D','ddeerson@gmail.com',0,'Y',1276027142922,1276027142922),(24,53807,'release','public','This is an awesome work, but it was noticed missing May 14, 2010, and has not yet resumed its place on the shelf as of June 4, 2010.  It was last played on the air Monday, April 26, 2010, immediately before 3pm.','Richard!','4da.wxyc.listserv@gmail.com',0,'Y',1276139297786,1276139297786),(25,6494,'release','error','It\'s missing one of the records (it should be a double LP)','David Deerson','ddeerson@gmail.com',0,'Y',1276843763785,1276843763785),(26,33160,'release','public','A spectacular synthesis of melodies and driving beats. I would call it dancy, but that would be an injustice. The album samples a variety of sounds and instruments into one seamless epic. You will listen to it over and over again. Sadly this band is no lo','Raj Saha','raj.saha80@gmail.com',0,'Y',1277116807464,1277116807464),(27,33160,'release','public','A spectacular synthesis of melodies and driving beats. I would call it dancy, but that would be an injustice. The album samples a variety of sounds and instruments into one seamless epic. You will listen to it over and over again. Sadly this band is no lo','Raj Saha','raj.saha80@gmail.com',0,'Y',1277116816350,1277116816350),(28,47402,'release','error','I think this album\'s title is \'Careless Love\' and not \'Madeleine Peyroux\'.','joseph','palis@unc.edu',0,'Y',1277388897913,1277388897913),(29,6412,'release','error','The correct title of this album is \"Dreamsville\" and not \'Durbansville\'','joseph','palis@unc.edu',0,'Y',1277388979753,1277388979753),(30,51585,'release','error','the name is ALVIN, not CALVIN','Alex Carll','carll@unc.edu',0,'Y',1278014367891,1278014367891),(31,55982,'release','public','kathleen, porcelain doll, and me and the devil are awesome tracks','frank f','fraboni@email.unc.ed',0,'Y',1281928922861,1281928922861),(32,19472,'release','error','one of their best, and it is MISSING!','Alex Carll','carll@unc.edu',0,'Y',1282422419327,1282422419327),(33,184,'release','error','can\'t find...may be in a bin though.','Alex Carll','carll@unc.edu',0,'Y',1282424955484,1282424955484),(34,53090,'release','public','Really wonderful stuff... see the excellent Lusafrica compilation \"Soul of Angola\" for more/similar musical goo